[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4746595149","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120409#issuecomment-4746595149","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120409","id":4746595149,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGutLTQ","user":{"login":"Paperzlel","id":123300405,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1lqNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123300405?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel","html_url":"https://github.com/Paperzlel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T22:22:08Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T22:22:08Z","body":"Your drivers are out of date by 7 years based on the version given, please try updating them first, then seeing if your problem is fixed. If not, try running the executable with Command Prompt and see what output it gives you, then send that here.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4746595149/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4750094670","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120409#issuecomment-4750094670","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120409","id":4750094670,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGyCxTg","user":{"login":"Eagle6393","id":241584057,"node_id":"U_kgDODmZHuQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/241584057?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393","html_url":"https://github.com/Eagle6393","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T08:58:42Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T08:58:42Z","body":"I checked the official NVIDIA website and driver version 425.31 is the latest available driver for the GeForce 920M. NVIDIA does not provide any newer drivers for this GPU. I also tested Godot 4.6 on the same laptop with the same driver and Forward+ works without any problems there. The issue only happens in Godot 4.7. I also tried running the console version of Godot. When I open a Forward+ project, the editor window appears, turns gray for a moment and then closes. Nothing is printed to the console before the crash.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4750094670/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4750330865","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120409#issuecomment-4750330865","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120409","id":4750330865,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGyRL8Q","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T09:32:31Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T09:32:31Z","body":"This seems like a driver issue indeed, but would be good to identify what changed in 4.7 to cause this","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4750330865/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4750356281","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120409#issuecomment-4750356281","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120409","id":4750356281,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGySvOQ","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T09:35:45Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T09:35:45Z","body":"Forward+ on Windows can run either on Vulkan or D3D12, configurable in project settings. Could you check which one is crashing, or if both crash?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4750356281/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4750843081","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120409#issuecomment-4750843081","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120409","id":4750843081,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGywcyQ","user":{"login":"Eagle6393","id":241584057,"node_id":"U_kgDODmZHuQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/241584057?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393","html_url":"https://github.com/Eagle6393","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T10:49:40Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T10:49:40Z","body":"I tested everything again. In Godot 4.7 Mobile renderer works normally with Vulkan and Compatibility renderer works normally with OpenGL. Direct3D 12 does not work in both 4.6 and 4.7. In Godot 4.7 Vulkan with Forward+ crashes immediately when launching the editor and the window turns gray and closes without any errors in the console. In Godot 4.6 Vulkan works correctly and Forward+ is stable on the same setup.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4750843081/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4750927237","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120409#issuecomment-4750927237","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120409","id":4750927237,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGy1lhQ","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T11:03:12Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T11:03:12Z","body":"Thanks, so there are likely two bugs:\n\n- Forward+ Vulkan now crashing in 4.7, didn't crash in 4.6. Let's keep this issue focused on that problem.\n- Forward+ D3D12 crashing both in 4.6 and 4.7. This would be worth tracking in a new issue. D3D12 is now the default for new projects since 4.6.\n\nThere's one more thing to clarify about your hardware and drivers though:\n\n> Windows 10/11 64-bit Intel Core i3-5005U 12 GB RAM NVIDIA GeForce 920M 2GB Intel HD Graphics 5500 NVIDIA driver 425.31\n\nYou have both an Intel HD Graphics 5500 integrated GPU and a discrete Nvidia 920M with drivers 425.31.\n\nCan you check whether you're running Godot on the Intel or Nvidia GPU in the various tests you made? If you run Godot from a terminal (with the `_console.exe` executable) you should see a line with GPU info like this:\n\n> Godot Engine v4.8.dev.custom_build.0dd6299f7 (2026-06-18 20:14:20 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\n> Vulkan 1.4.335 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: AMD - AMD Radeon 780M Graphics (RADV PHOENIX)\n\nCan you also check which drivers you have for the Intel HD 5500? It may help to ensure you have the latest there too.\n\nFinally, you mention Windows 10/11, are you really running both on that hardware? Nvidia doesn't seem to even provide drivers for 920M on Windows 11 anymore.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4750927237/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4751056208","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120409#issuecomment-4751056208","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120409","id":4751056208,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGy9dUA","user":{"login":"Eagle6393","id":241584057,"node_id":"U_kgDODmZHuQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/241584057?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393","html_url":"https://github.com/Eagle6393","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T11:22:08Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T11:22:08Z","body":"Thanks, got it. I’m using the NVIDIA 920M in all tests, not the Intel GPU. The console always shows the NVIDIA device being used. About Windows 10/11, that was just my bad wording — I’m actually only on Windows 10. For the Intel HD 5500 driver, it just updates through Windows itself and stays on the 20.19.15.x branch. There are no newer official drivers for it.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4751056208/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4751159428","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120409#issuecomment-4751159428","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120409","id":4751159428,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGzDwhA","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T11:34:03Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T11:34:03Z","body":"920M is not DirectX 12 capable device (only supports level 11_0), and D3D renderer requires the 12_0 feature level and shader model 6.0 support. So D3D not working is expected.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4751159428/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4751181515","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120409#issuecomment-4751181515","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120409","id":4751181515,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGzFGyw","user":{"login":"Eagle6393","id":241584057,"node_id":"U_kgDODmZHuQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/241584057?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393","html_url":"https://github.com/Eagle6393","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T11:36:45Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T11:36:45Z","body":"Thanks for the clarification. That makes sense regarding D3D12, I understand that my GPU does not support the required feature level.\nHowever, the main issue is still with Forward+ in Godot 4.7, because it crashes immediately even when Vulkan is used, while Vulkan works correctly in the Mobile renderer on the same system.\nIn Godot 4.6 Forward+ works correctly with Vulkan, so the difference between 4.6 and 4.7 is the key part of the issue here.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4751181515/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4751324204","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120409#issuecomment-4751324204","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120409","id":4751324204,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGzN0LA","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T11:58:28Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T11:58:28Z","body":"> 920M is not DirectX 12 capable device (only supports level 11_0), and D3D renderer requires the 12_0 feature level and shader model 6.0 support. So D3D not working is expected.\n\n@Eagle6393 Does running D3D12 fully crash, or is there a dialog that explains that D3D12 isn't supported?\n\nI would expect that on hardware where D3D12 is not supported at all, it should be handled gracefully and explain to the user why they can't run the app. And maybe fallback to Vulkan or OpenGL? (Maybe it _is_ falling back to Vulkan, which crashes on 4.7?)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4751324204/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4751541293","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120409#issuecomment-4751541293","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120409","id":4751541293,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGzbELQ","user":{"login":"Eagle6393","id":241584057,"node_id":"U_kgDODmZHuQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/241584057?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393","html_url":"https://github.com/Eagle6393","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T12:25:51Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T12:25:51Z","body":"Here is the test with Godot 4.7. I explicitly selected Vulkan as the rendering backend and switched from Mobile renderer to Forward+ inside the project settings, then applied the change and restarted the editor. I already performed this same test earlier as well, and the result is consistent. During restart, the engine tries to reinitialize the project with Forward+ and immediately crashes before the editor fully opens. The Godot editor window turns gray for a moment and then the application closes instantly with no logs or error messages in the console.\n\nI also attached the log from Godot 4.6 for comparison. In 4.6 the same system correctly handles D3D12 failure, falls back to Vulkan, and Forward+ works normally without any issues.\n\nLog from Godot 4.6:\nOpenGL API 3.3.0 NVIDIA 425.31 - Compatibility - Using Device: NVIDIA - GeForce 920M\nERROR: No support for Typed UAV Load Additional Formats has been found.\nERROR: Failed to initialize driver for device.\nWARNING: Your video card drivers seem not to support Direct3D 12, switching to Vulkan.\nVulkan 1.1.95 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - GeForce 920M\n\nSo in 4.6 the fallback chain works correctly, but in 4.7 Forward+ crashes immediately during initialization before the editor fully loads.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4751541293/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762710109","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120409#issuecomment-4762710109","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120409","id":4762710109,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG-EwXQ","user":{"login":"Eagle6393","id":241584057,"node_id":"U_kgDODmZHuQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/241584057?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393","html_url":"https://github.com/Eagle6393","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eagle6393/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-21T17:15:31Z","updated_at":"2026-06-21T17:15:31Z","body":"I did some more testing and found something that may help. I tested every 4.7 build I could find, including dev1, later dev builds, betas, release candidates and the final 4.7 release. The crash already happens in 4.7 dev1, the very first development build of 4.7. Every 4.7 build I tested behaves the same way, while 4.6 continues to work correctly with Forward+. This suggests the regression was introduced before or during the changes that first appeared in 4.7 dev1 and was not caused by something added later in the 4.7 development cycle.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4762710109/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4792540658","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120409#issuecomment-4792540658","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120409","id":4792540658,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHahd8g","user":{"login":"JohnRaul508","id":76977303,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTc3MzAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76977303?v=4","grava